<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that your pre-selected meal wasn’t available onboard your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’ve always taken pride in the quality and range of the catering we offer on board, including the special meals we provide for customers with <strong><em>-dietary/religious-</em></strong> requirements.<br />
<br />
While we implement measures to minimise mishaps, human errors by our caterers or cabin crew still occasionally happen. I understand this must have been disappointing.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>A little something from us</strong><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
<b>Refer to your team leader for instruction.</b><br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your comments to the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience. I hope we can welcome you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>